  "displayName": "Ling-3.1-Flash",
  "provider": "InclusionAI",
  "description": "Ling-3.1-flash boasts approximately 560B total parameters, with each Token activating around 25B parameters. The model's context window has an upper limit of 1M, allowing for longer documents, code, and task histories. During the research and development process, we have continuously optimized the model for tasks such as general intelligence agents, search, daily office work, and software development, while also enhancing its capabilities in scenarios like healthcare, finance, and materials science research.",
  "zhDescription": "Ling-3.1-flash 拥有约 560B 总参数，每个 Token 激活约 25B 参数；模型上下文窗口上限为 1M，可容纳更长的文档、代码和任务历史。在研发过程中，我们围绕通用智能体、搜索、日常办公和软件研发等任务持续优化，并在医疗、金融和材料科学研究等场景持续提升模型能力。",
  "longDescription": "Ling-3.1-flash boasts approximately 560B total parameters, with each Token activating around 25B parameters. The model's context window has an upper limit of 1M, allowing for longer documents, code, and task histories. During the research and development process, we have continuously optimized the model for tasks such as general intelligence agents, search, daily office work, and software development, while also enhancing its capabilities in scenarios like healthcare, finance, and materials science research.",
